{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12231050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12231050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1223105001:0":{"text":"我的货……我的货！喔唷，全都掉到地上了！这下卖不出去了！","source_cn":"我的货……我的货！喔唷，全都掉到地上了！这下卖不出去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9A11A3A3569C21F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223105002:0":{"text":"喂！肮脏的水鬼，你们故意的是不是！","source_cn":"喂！肮脏的水鬼，你们故意的是不是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x998BA57E8BF811CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223105003:0":{"text":"我大发慈悲给你们工作的机会，你们就是这样回报我的？","source_cn":"我大发慈悲给你们工作的机会，你们就是这样回报我的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE485C1213FF19753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223105004:0":{"text":"这是误会，老板。都怪血薇帮，不然货也不会弄脏。","source_cn":"这是误会，老板。都怪血薇帮，不然货也不会弄脏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA459DFF068129D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1223105005:0":{"text":"误会？是啊！我误认为你们不收钱，是真的想改过自新！能把这批货好好送到目的地！","source_cn":"误会？是啊！我误认为你们不收钱，是真的想改过自新！能把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9241ED9AA4FD1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223105006:1":{"text":"唉，算我倒霉！就不该相信水鬼还能改过自新！","source_cn":"唉，算我倒霉！就不该相信水鬼还能改过自新！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE11775760398086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223105007:0":{"text":"等一下，你雇佣了水鬼帮？","source_cn":"等一下，你雇佣了水鬼帮？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DDB88F1704397E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1223105008:0":{"text":"是啊，怎么了？","source_cn":"是啊，怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFCDEDAA3356C600","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1223105009:1":{"text":"什么！他们不是在打劫吗？","source_cn":"什么！他们不是在打劫吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D49CE9BD8CF65AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1223105010:0":{"text":"这是我的货，我让他们搬的！打什么劫！","source_cn":"这是我的货，我让他们搬的！打什么劫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EC8430A5270D3F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1223105011:0":{"text":"真倒霉，好不容易良心发现想送个货，居然也被当做打劫……","source_cn":"真倒霉，好不容易良心发现想送个货，居然也被当做打劫……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4419A85F68213223","variant_statu